{"id":"96c925b05567b126","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness.md","title":"传递集合间的 Δ₀ 绝对性","display":"thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness — 传递集合间的 Δ₀ 绝对性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness","aliases":["72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness"],"display":"thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness — 传递集合间的 Δ₀ 绝对性","depends_on":["[[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.2 Δ0 absoluteness discussion, print216/PDF228; local induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness — 传递集合间的 Δ₀ 绝对性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"676fecd09411613c\" href=\"?note=676fecd09411613c\" title=\"72-df-set-theory-syntax\">72-df-set-theory-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.2 Δ0 absoluteness discussion, print216/PDF228; local induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N\\)</span> 均为传递集合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in M\\ (a\\subseteq M)\">\\(\\forall a\\in M\\ (a\\subseteq M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in N\\ (a\\subseteq N)\">\\(\\forall a\\in N\\ (a\\subseteq N)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta^s_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta^s_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\)</span> 上相同；语法语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"676fecd09411613c\" href=\"?note=676fecd09411613c\" title=\"72-df-set-theory-syntax\">72-df-set-theory-syntax</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,\\gamma\\models_s A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad N,\\eta\\models_s A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,\\gamma\\models_s A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad N,\\eta\\models_s A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按有界公式生成归纳。布尔及原子分支直接成立。对边界变量 y 的同一个值 a∈M，传递性保证 a 的每个成员仍在 M，因此两个结构中的有界量词恰遍历相同集合 a。更新量化变量后归纳成立。不能将该结论扩展到无界存在量词；例如 N 可能有 M 所没有的集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"676fecd09411613c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"676fecd09411613c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N$ 均为传递集合，即 $\\forall a\\in M\\ (a\\subseteq M)$、$\\forall a\\in N\\ (a\\subseteq N)$。$A\\in\\Delta^s_0$，$\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$，$\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$ 在 $\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)$ 上相同；语法语义取 [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in M\\ (a\\subseteq M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in N\\ (a\\subseteq N)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Delta^s_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\gamma\\models_s A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad N,\\eta\\models_s A.","display":true}],"bytes":1578,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-502","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] ·